WEBVTT

01:33.219 --> 01:35.553
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.593 --> 01:37.866
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:37.986 --> 01:40.753
(Episode 11)

01:45.120 --> 01:46.120
Qin Qin.

01:47.001 --> 01:48.001
It's time to go home.

01:50.521 --> 01:51.521
Who is he?

01:52.840 --> 01:53.840
My brother.

01:55.161 --> 01:56.176
You think I'm stupid?

01:56.200 --> 01:57.200
It's true.

02:05.161 --> 02:06.161
You're not going with him.

02:07.400 --> 02:08.400
Let her go.

02:08.561 --> 02:09.600
Who asked you?

02:12.800 --> 02:14.217
Stop fighting, Yan Chen.

02:14.241 --> 02:15.241
Stop!

02:15.561 --> 02:17.480
Stop fighting, Yan Chen.

02:18.841 --> 02:19.841
Stop fighting.

02:20.001 --> 02:21.001
Enough already.

02:21.841 --> 02:22.841
Who will you go with?

02:24.520 --> 02:25.520
With who?

02:41.841 --> 02:42.841
Song Yan.

02:43.121 --> 02:44.320
I have to go home.

03:40.121 --> 03:42.281
She's drunk. The cold air will make her sick.

03:42.800 --> 03:45.721
Adjust the backseat vent lower so it doesn't blow straight at her.

03:58.401 --> 03:59.561
Where are we headed?

03:59.760 --> 04:00.760
To my parents' house.

04:02.480 --> 04:04.161
You're taking her back there in her state?

04:04.360 --> 04:05.360
Are you nuts?

04:05.600 --> 04:07.121
My parents would be asleep at this hour.

04:07.520 --> 04:08.640
They won't see her.

04:10.760 --> 04:11.760
Meng Yan Chen.

04:12.441 --> 04:13.841
She was in a bad mood

04:14.441 --> 04:15.616
so she drank to vent a little.

04:15.640 --> 04:16.640
Is this really necessary?

04:17.160 --> 04:19.241
Can't you be more understanding of your sister?

04:48.041 --> 04:50.760
(You don't like me all that much, do you?)

04:52.840 --> 04:55.481
(Why won't you come?)

04:55.760 --> 04:58.561
(Is it because you don't actually like me?)

04:59.041 --> 05:00.457
(If you didn't like me, )

05:00.481 --> 05:02.760
(then why did you say those things?)

05:03.121 --> 05:04.857
Why did you tell me

05:04.881 --> 05:07.080
that you were head over heels for me?

05:07.481 --> 05:09.561
I took it seriously.

05:10.160 --> 05:11.537
I took it seriously.

05:11.561 --> 05:14.241
I took it seriously!

06:27.400 --> 06:28.400
Qin.

06:30.720 --> 06:31.720
What's the matter?

06:32.881 --> 06:33.881
Yan Chen.

06:33.921 --> 06:34.921
I'm scared.

06:35.921 --> 06:36.921
It's all right.

06:37.280 --> 06:38.280
I'm here.

06:38.520 --> 06:39.520
Don't be scared.

06:41.881 --> 06:43.960
Come, you can sleep with me.

08:22.960 --> 08:24.760
Yan, are you going to look for her?

08:29.640 --> 08:31.481
Yan, just a little reminder.

08:31.881 --> 08:33.840
She was drunk and acted out of character.

08:34.040 --> 08:35.217
They don't mean anything.

08:35.241 --> 08:37.001
The rift between you two is still there.

08:39.440 --> 08:40.440
I know.

08:41.800 --> 08:43.040
Then why are you still going to her?

08:43.640 --> 08:45.800
You're 29, not 19.

08:46.201 --> 08:48.361
If you refuse to let go, you'll break down.

08:56.800 --> 08:57.800
Zhai Miao.

08:59.001 --> 09:00.201
After what happened last night,

09:01.081 --> 09:02.201
what is going to happen now

09:03.481 --> 09:04.640
if I don't go to see her?

09:05.520 --> 09:06.961
She probably won't ever look for you again.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.640
That's why I'm going to her.

09:11.961 --> 09:14.640
Yan, do you really like her that much?

09:15.040 --> 09:17.081
You said it yourself. It's fine when you don't see her.

09:17.321 --> 09:18.520
So don't go to see her.

09:21.040 --> 09:22.201
But she's here.

09:22.560 --> 09:23.881
So I have to get her.

09:24.920 --> 09:25.920
She's here?

09:26.680 --> 09:27.680
Where?

09:28.361 --> 09:29.481
How come I didn't see her?

09:33.081 --> 09:34.081
All right.

09:34.361 --> 09:35.361
Go to school.

09:35.920 --> 09:36.920
Stop meddling in my affairs.

09:40.520 --> 09:41.520
Yan.

09:42.881 --> 09:45.616
-Yan! -The soy milk today looks very fresh.

09:45.640 --> 09:47.496
Dad, Mom, help me stop Yan.

09:47.520 --> 09:49.121
-What's wrong? -He's looking for Xu Qin again.

09:50.280 --> 09:52.201
He put on a front and denied he liked her.

09:52.280 --> 09:53.440
Now, the girl waved to him

09:53.760 --> 09:55.160
and he's scrambling to go to her.

09:55.680 --> 09:56.680
Take this, Miao.

09:57.201 --> 09:58.697
-Go have breakfast inside. -Yes.

09:58.721 --> 10:00.097
-Go eat breakfast. Open the door. -Dad.

10:00.121 --> 10:02.097
-Just go inside. -Hurry up. This is heavy.

10:02.121 --> 10:03.121
Hurry up and go.

10:05.160 --> 10:06.160
Talk to him.

10:10.400 --> 10:11.760
You're going to look for Xu Qin?

10:14.680 --> 10:15.680
Yan.

10:16.201 --> 10:17.361
After your dad left,

10:17.800 --> 10:19.640
you were raised by me and your aunt.

10:20.040 --> 10:21.520
We treat you like our own son.

10:22.201 --> 10:24.920
I know how you are very well.

10:25.640 --> 10:27.040
You're more bark than bite.

10:27.560 --> 10:29.400
You said you don't like her, you despise her.

10:29.560 --> 10:30.601
Those were lies.

10:31.081 --> 10:32.337
No matter how much you've suffered,

10:32.361 --> 10:34.560
the moment you see her, everything...

10:35.920 --> 10:37.001
Since young,

10:37.800 --> 10:38.841
you've been hard-headed.

10:39.601 --> 10:40.601
When it comes to love,

10:41.321 --> 10:43.400
you never listen to your aunt's and my input.

10:44.721 --> 10:45.721
If you wish to go,

10:46.121 --> 10:47.121
then go.

10:48.640 --> 10:49.640
However,

10:50.001 --> 10:51.121
just this time.

10:52.241 --> 10:53.440
This one time.

10:54.800 --> 10:55.800
No matter what,

10:56.481 --> 10:59.440
it's not right for them to trample on a person time and time again.

11:01.961 --> 11:02.961
Understand, child?

12:12.201 --> 12:13.201
Hello?

12:20.081 --> 12:21.081
It's me.

12:21.881 --> 12:22.920
I know.

12:26.121 --> 12:27.121
Are you sober?

12:31.920 --> 12:32.920
Where are you?

12:34.241 --> 12:35.241
At home.

12:36.721 --> 12:37.721
(I'll go see you.)

12:39.121 --> 12:40.440
I'm at my parents' house.

12:54.640 --> 12:55.760
Give me a minute.

12:56.040 --> 12:57.081
I'll go back now.

13:01.881 --> 13:02.881
Okay.

14:05.881 --> 14:09.136
Miss Xu, is that your friend? He's waited a long time.

14:09.160 --> 14:11.560
You weren't home, so I didn't let him in.

14:13.640 --> 14:14.656
Okay. Thanks.

14:14.680 --> 14:15.680
No problem.

14:23.321 --> 14:25.841
Sorry to keep you waiting.

14:27.721 --> 14:28.721
Have you had breakfast?

14:30.081 --> 14:31.081
Not yet.

14:31.601 --> 14:32.601
What do you feel like eating?

14:36.241 --> 14:37.241
Porridge.

14:38.640 --> 14:39.640
What kind?

14:40.201 --> 14:41.201
Plain porridge.

14:43.280 --> 14:45.040
I don't think there's any nearby.

14:46.680 --> 14:47.920
There's rice and water at my house.

14:58.081 --> 14:59.081
Let's go.

15:11.640 --> 15:12.721
You don't cook.

15:13.121 --> 15:14.121
Why do you have rice?

15:14.721 --> 15:15.721
It's from the hospital.

15:18.601 --> 15:19.680
When did they give this out?

15:20.881 --> 15:21.881
I don't remember.

15:22.361 --> 15:23.361
Is it expired?

15:23.881 --> 15:25.160
Rice doesn't expire, does it?

15:28.121 --> 15:29.481
Do you even have common sense?

15:37.560 --> 15:38.680
Just that bit of rice?

15:40.081 --> 15:41.081
It becomes more when cooked.

16:10.841 --> 16:11.841
I'll get a bowl.

16:25.721 --> 16:26.800
You never cook at home?

16:27.800 --> 16:28.800
Then what do you eat?

16:29.721 --> 16:30.721
Takeaways?

16:33.160 --> 16:34.400
Sometimes, I get food delivery.

16:35.361 --> 16:36.920
Sometimes, I eat at the hospital canteen.

16:37.601 --> 16:38.601
What about you?

16:40.040 --> 16:41.040
The station has a canteen.

16:42.640 --> 16:43.640
If I'm off,

16:44.001 --> 16:45.001
and I'm home,

16:45.601 --> 16:46.601
my aunt cooks.

16:47.361 --> 16:49.121
Mrs. Zhai's cooking is delicious.

16:54.800 --> 16:56.201
How's the food at the station canteen?

16:56.601 --> 16:57.601
Not too bad.

16:58.280 --> 16:59.280
Yours?

17:00.400 --> 17:01.440
So-so.

17:01.760 --> 17:02.760
It's not very good.

17:27.640 --> 17:28.640
Have some water.

18:39.841 --> 18:40.841
It smells good.

18:43.121 --> 18:44.121
You must be hungry.

18:45.321 --> 18:46.321
It's almost done.

18:47.801 --> 18:48.801
Okay.

19:19.240 --> 19:20.240
Xu Qin.

19:23.121 --> 19:24.440
Do you remember

19:26.081 --> 19:27.081
what you said yesterday?

19:32.841 --> 19:33.841
I remember some parts.

19:34.680 --> 19:35.680
Not everything.

19:37.761 --> 19:38.761
You said,

19:40.680 --> 19:41.841
you'll never go to me again.

19:43.720 --> 19:46.521
Do you remember that part?

19:55.440 --> 19:56.720
You're not drunk now, right?

20:01.200 --> 20:02.200
So are you

20:04.361 --> 20:05.361
still going to say that now?

20:13.881 --> 20:14.920
I don't know.

20:24.841 --> 20:25.920
What if I go to you?

20:28.801 --> 20:29.920
Can you wait?

20:41.200 --> 20:42.281
Waiting without certainty.

20:44.000 --> 20:45.160
Even I feel bad for you.

20:51.761 --> 20:52.761
I don't know

20:54.841 --> 20:56.160
what I should do right now.

21:01.640 --> 21:03.680
I don't know how to ask you,

21:05.081 --> 21:06.361
or ask myself.

21:07.680 --> 21:08.801
I also don't know

21:10.321 --> 21:11.680
how to face you

21:12.240 --> 21:13.521
or my family.

21:14.480 --> 21:16.361
-I... -I know you're scared.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.761
I just want you to know.

21:21.081 --> 21:22.160
If you're determined enough,

21:23.121 --> 21:24.761
I will bear whatever happens after.

21:27.121 --> 21:28.121
If you are brave enough,

21:29.000 --> 21:30.081
then I'll shoulder it.

21:43.480 --> 21:44.480
But I get it.

21:46.480 --> 21:47.640
The words sound nice

21:49.680 --> 21:50.680
but they're useless.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.521
I don't have enough courage.

22:02.841 --> 22:03.841
To be honest,

22:05.521 --> 22:07.041
I feel bad that I put you

22:08.640 --> 22:09.640
in this predicament.

22:12.601 --> 22:13.920
I know your good intention.

22:31.761 --> 22:32.920
What I can promise you

22:33.521 --> 22:34.521
is to treat you good.

22:35.000 --> 22:36.160
I'll be good to you every day.

22:36.841 --> 22:37.841
I'll never betray you.

22:37.960 --> 22:38.960
I'll stay committed.

22:40.160 --> 22:42.200
I'll do everything I can do give you a better life.

22:44.321 --> 22:45.561
What I cannot guarantee

22:46.801 --> 22:47.920
is whether or not

22:48.960 --> 22:50.400
my commitment to you fits your

22:51.680 --> 22:53.041
or your family's bill.

22:55.801 --> 22:57.121
I know you're in a difficult position.

22:58.960 --> 22:59.960
I also know

23:01.761 --> 23:03.081
that if we do get together,

23:06.281 --> 23:07.561
you'd be aggrieved.

23:09.720 --> 23:10.720
I understand that.

23:13.601 --> 23:14.601
But...

23:20.761 --> 23:23.321
You can't keep swooping into my life without any repercussions.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.200
Be together,

23:30.240 --> 23:31.440
or never see each other again.

23:34.041 --> 23:35.041
Make your choice.

24:47.281 --> 24:48.720
(Did I not tell you?)

24:49.881 --> 24:52.000
(Stay away from dubious characters.)

24:53.801 --> 24:55.160
(You have no love for yourself.)

24:56.680 --> 24:58.160
If you insist on being with him,

24:59.920 --> 25:03.601
then forget about going to university.

25:06.200 --> 25:07.680
You can relinquish this family, too.

25:09.081 --> 25:10.081
Next time,

25:10.761 --> 25:12.160
you can stop calling me "Mom."

25:13.801 --> 25:14.801
Mommy.

25:19.720 --> 25:20.720
Qin Qin.

25:22.041 --> 25:23.521
Please listen to me.

25:24.361 --> 25:25.680
I only want the best for you.

25:27.601 --> 25:29.561
I'm willing to give you the world.

25:31.720 --> 25:32.720
But if

25:34.920 --> 25:36.801
you're going to act willfully

25:37.000 --> 25:38.400
and disregard this home,

25:41.400 --> 25:42.881
then I'm going to find a way

25:43.601 --> 25:44.680
to send you away.

25:46.160 --> 25:49.160
There's no use pleading to your father or brother.

25:50.160 --> 25:51.160
I will do

25:51.960 --> 25:52.960
what I said.

25:53.640 --> 25:54.640
Mom.

26:00.440 --> 26:01.440
Qin Qin.

26:03.720 --> 26:05.601
His parents aren't good people.

26:06.521 --> 26:08.321
What do you expect from their kid?

26:10.720 --> 26:12.521
You've really disappointed me.

26:13.801 --> 26:15.160
You break my heart

26:16.561 --> 26:18.281
because of a guy like that?

26:20.720 --> 26:22.640
The care and love I gave you all these years

26:24.640 --> 26:27.281
just went up in smoke.

26:36.440 --> 26:37.440
Mommy.

26:38.881 --> 26:40.200
I'll do as you say.

29:30.720 --> 29:31.841
Why are you here so early?

29:32.640 --> 29:33.680
I came to take you to work.

29:34.841 --> 29:35.841
Have you eaten?

29:37.841 --> 29:38.841
Yes.

29:42.200 --> 29:43.200
Let's go.

29:51.680 --> 29:52.761
Actually,

29:53.761 --> 29:55.081
you didn't have to drive me home yesterday.

29:56.841 --> 29:58.321
Even if you hadn't reminded me,

29:59.561 --> 30:00.920
I wouldn't have dared rebel.

30:03.601 --> 30:04.881
What are you scared of?

30:06.561 --> 30:07.881
You thought because I'm older,

30:08.361 --> 30:09.400
I wouldn't listen to anyone

30:10.041 --> 30:11.440
and leave the nest without thought?

30:14.400 --> 30:17.041
Do you know how an animal trainer train animals?

30:19.081 --> 30:20.720
While the animal is young,

30:22.121 --> 30:24.680
they'd beat it, starve it, lock it up.

30:25.960 --> 30:29.041
But also dote on it, feed it, care for it.

30:32.160 --> 30:33.361
When the animal grows up,

30:33.920 --> 30:34.920
has more power,

30:36.561 --> 30:40.321
it still shrinks back at the sight of the whip and bowl.

30:42.240 --> 30:43.640
It no longer dares to go to the wild.

30:45.200 --> 30:46.281
All of you say

30:47.801 --> 30:48.920
he's not good enough for me.

30:51.000 --> 30:52.761
But the fact is, I'm not good enough for him.

30:55.361 --> 30:56.521
When I'm with him,

30:57.761 --> 30:58.801
I feel like

31:00.321 --> 31:02.480
I could hurt him at any time.

31:05.400 --> 31:07.480
Because the truth is I'm cowardly.

31:08.081 --> 31:09.440
I want everything,

31:10.920 --> 31:12.680
but I'm scared of losing anything.

31:15.041 --> 31:17.761
I want Dad, Mom, and you.

31:19.121 --> 31:20.440
I also want Song Yan.

31:24.041 --> 31:25.041
I

31:26.801 --> 31:27.841
Don't have the courage,

31:28.720 --> 31:29.720
nor the guts.

31:31.440 --> 31:32.761
I can't bear to face anything.

31:33.200 --> 31:34.400
I only know to run away.

31:37.000 --> 31:38.440
I'm incapable of love.

31:39.841 --> 31:41.160
Nor do I have the right to love.

31:43.881 --> 31:45.521
I don't deserve love from anyone.

31:59.361 --> 32:00.361
Let's leave the country.

32:01.521 --> 32:03.521
Let's go abroad, Qin Qin.

32:04.200 --> 32:05.801
We won't ever come back.

32:14.640 --> 32:15.640
Bye, Yan Chen.

32:44.200 --> 32:45.200
Well?

32:45.521 --> 32:46.521
The air is good, right?

32:47.160 --> 32:49.121
You should come out more often.

32:51.000 --> 32:53.777
You really know what hospital staff need, Mrs. Meng.

32:53.801 --> 32:56.000
We're overwhelmed by the smell of disinfectant in the hospital.

32:56.321 --> 32:58.081
It's nice to be out enjoying the fresh air.

32:59.000 --> 33:00.000
Mr. Liu.

33:00.041 --> 33:01.400
I was going to ask you.

33:01.640 --> 33:04.240
My child has been working at the hospital for a while now.

33:04.561 --> 33:05.561
How is it?

33:05.881 --> 33:08.321
Are the seniors and professors happy with her performance?

33:09.200 --> 33:10.680
Very pleased.

33:11.281 --> 33:14.121
Young Dr. Xu is serious about work.

33:14.240 --> 33:15.680
And she's compassionate with patients.

33:16.200 --> 33:19.361
The hospital has chosen her to be a key candidate for promotion.

33:21.521 --> 33:24.281
I thank you for the guidance on behalf of my daughter.

33:24.601 --> 33:25.601
It's my pleasure.

33:31.640 --> 33:32.640
Dr. Xu.

33:34.881 --> 33:37.480
May I know why my interview application was rejected?

33:41.041 --> 33:43.400
Trying to get a foot in through connections doesn't fly with me.

33:43.960 --> 33:45.361
Go back and tell your family.

33:45.601 --> 33:47.121
Quit asking Deputy Dean Liu to contact me.

33:47.720 --> 33:49.081
My medical team

33:49.200 --> 33:52.761
needs only young people who have a sincere passion for the job.

33:53.480 --> 33:54.480
And not someone

33:54.920 --> 33:57.841
who thinks they can get what they want by taking shortcuts.

33:59.000 --> 34:00.376
But you know I have the best skills

34:00.400 --> 34:02.160
among the batch of young doctors.

34:06.200 --> 34:07.841
A doctor needs to have comprehensive skills.

34:08.521 --> 34:10.560
I don't think you're the best at that.

34:10.881 --> 34:11.960
If it's being conceited,

34:12.960 --> 34:13.960
you're probably the best.

34:16.000 --> 34:17.000
Dr. Xu.

34:17.361 --> 34:20.161
Honestly, I believe Dr. Xu has what it takes.

34:20.520 --> 34:22.440
Maybe you should reconsider.

34:23.353 --> 34:26.873
(The red fleet takes charge, serving Yancheng)

34:30.721 --> 34:31.721
Yang.

34:32.321 --> 34:34.201
Did you hear anything about the new instructor?

34:34.241 --> 34:35.241
Is he amicable?

34:35.480 --> 34:36.480
What kind of a character is he?

34:36.841 --> 34:38.440
I don't know if he's amicable.

34:39.281 --> 34:41.520
But if Yan can get along with him, then I can, too.

34:41.801 --> 34:44.361
No need to think so much. We'll know when he arrives this afternoon.

34:45.241 --> 34:47.440
I heard he came from the headquarters.

34:47.920 --> 34:49.721
He comes from a prominent family.

34:50.040 --> 34:52.257
Why isn't he taking it easy in an air-conditioned office

34:52.281 --> 34:53.281
but chose to come here then?

34:54.560 --> 34:55.600
I reckon he decided to come

34:56.120 --> 34:58.016
to get a jumpstart, get himself gilded.

34:58.040 --> 35:00.560
I won't be surprised if he left before too long.

35:01.960 --> 35:03.560
Knowing our captain's temper,

35:03.841 --> 35:06.201
who can say whether he'll get gilded or skinned?

35:07.400 --> 35:08.400
Honestly,

35:08.560 --> 35:10.681
I miss Jun.

35:12.241 --> 35:13.560
An instructor like Jun?

35:14.920 --> 35:16.120
There won't be a second one.

35:18.560 --> 35:19.560
In the past,

35:20.080 --> 35:21.201
we were tired of his nagging.

35:21.361 --> 35:22.761
Now that it's quiet,

35:22.920 --> 35:24.080
I'm not used to it.

35:26.400 --> 35:27.400
Chi.

35:27.841 --> 35:29.881
Yi. The new instructor is about to arrive.

35:31.281 --> 35:32.777
-Not this afternoon? -It was brought forward.

35:32.801 --> 35:33.976
Speak of the devil.

35:34.000 --> 35:35.000
Let's go welcome him.

35:35.400 --> 35:36.536
All right, guys. Stop what you're doing.

35:36.560 --> 35:37.681
Let's go greet the new instructor.

35:38.161 --> 35:39.480
-Let's go. -Okay.

35:52.321 --> 35:54.177
Hello, Captain Song.

35:54.201 --> 35:55.201
Long time no see.

35:55.480 --> 35:58.400
You said I could look for you at Shili Tai Fire and Rescue Station.

36:01.960 --> 36:02.960
Hello.

36:04.520 --> 36:05.520
Where's the new instructor?

36:05.641 --> 36:06.641
I am him.

36:13.560 --> 36:14.600
This is my assignment order.

36:20.801 --> 36:21.801
You are Jiang Yu?

36:22.161 --> 36:24.040
Guess you don't remember me the last time.

36:24.641 --> 36:27.120
Then allow me to formally introduce myself.

36:27.721 --> 36:28.721
My name is Jiang Yu.

36:29.000 --> 36:31.520
I'm the new instructor based at Shili Tai Fire and Rescue Station.

36:31.641 --> 36:33.480
Starting today, I'll be joining the team.

36:33.801 --> 36:34.834
Pleased to meet everyone.

36:41.321 --> 36:42.657
-Yang Chi. -Here.

36:42.681 --> 36:44.761
What are you people doing, just standing there?

36:45.120 --> 36:46.120
Are you electric poles or what?

36:46.841 --> 36:49.000
-Hello, sir. -Welcome, welcome.

36:50.960 --> 36:52.376
-No need to fuss. -Thanks for coming.

36:52.400 --> 36:53.576
No need to fuss, guys.

36:53.600 --> 36:55.600
I can manage, yes.

36:57.641 --> 37:00.456
The instructor has a kind face. Should be friendly.

37:00.480 --> 37:03.321
But why does it seem like there's tension between him and Captain?

37:03.400 --> 37:04.400
Bro.

37:04.600 --> 37:07.000
Right now, could you just zip that loud mouth of yours?

37:08.241 --> 37:09.241
Let's go.

37:10.161 --> 37:11.400
Close the door.

37:30.040 --> 37:33.040
Thank you for coming to the interview.

37:34.881 --> 37:36.721
Hope there's another opportunity to see you again.

37:41.480 --> 37:44.201
-Thanks, sir. -Keep working hard. Okay.

37:48.040 --> 37:50.080
All right, that's all for today.

37:51.881 --> 37:52.881
Dr. Xu.

37:53.520 --> 37:54.520
What are you doing here?

37:56.761 --> 37:58.416
Your name is not in the list of interviewees.

37:58.440 --> 38:00.321
I'm sorry. I wish to fight for my spot.

38:00.440 --> 38:02.040
The interview session has concluded.

38:03.201 --> 38:04.976
Please take a look at my application

38:05.000 --> 38:07.040
before you decide whether or not I deserve a chance.

38:09.281 --> 38:12.161
I believe that a hospital is where professionalism is valued.

38:12.400 --> 38:14.777
If you think I'm lacking in certain areas outside of my expertise,

38:14.801 --> 38:17.040
please do tell me so that I can learn from you.

38:20.520 --> 38:21.681
Are you mocking me?

38:23.480 --> 38:25.080
No, sir. Don't get me wrong.

38:27.080 --> 38:28.080
Fine.

38:28.600 --> 38:29.600
Tell me, then.

38:29.960 --> 38:31.161
Why do you want to be a doctor?

38:35.440 --> 38:36.440
Don't be nervous.

38:36.881 --> 38:37.920
Think before you answer.

38:42.801 --> 38:43.801
Because

38:46.920 --> 38:48.040
the job is secure.

39:01.201 --> 39:03.241
I've got to hand it to Dr. Xu.

39:03.600 --> 39:05.257
Knowing how the director is,

39:05.281 --> 39:07.080
she still dared to test his patience.

39:08.120 --> 39:09.817
I heard from the Deputy Director.

39:09.841 --> 39:11.657
When Dr. Xu answered the first question like that,

39:11.681 --> 39:13.841
she almost passed out thinking it was all over.

39:14.241 --> 39:15.376
Who would've thought

39:15.400 --> 39:17.120
she could pass the interview in the end?

39:17.321 --> 39:18.321
Odd, isn't it?

39:18.520 --> 39:20.321
What to do? She has the ability.

39:20.400 --> 39:22.080
Can't fault her for being smug.

39:23.801 --> 39:24.801
It's going to get interesting.

39:24.881 --> 39:27.841
She's now on the same team as the ultra-smug Yang Si Jia.

39:28.040 --> 39:29.641
Let's wait and see what drama would unfold.

39:31.560 --> 39:32.560
Am I smug?

39:33.641 --> 39:34.641
Dr. Yang.

39:37.361 --> 39:39.080
Where's my phone?

39:39.560 --> 39:42.281
-Where's my phone? -Maybe you left it in the lobby.

39:42.400 --> 39:43.520
I'll go look for it.

39:53.721 --> 39:54.721
Dr. Xu.

39:56.560 --> 39:57.560
Welcome to the team.

39:58.321 --> 39:59.321
Shake hands?

40:00.361 --> 40:02.520
I just washed my hands, so I won't shake hands.

40:05.440 --> 40:07.000
Well, here's a gentle reminder.

40:07.440 --> 40:08.641
Director Xu is very strict.

40:09.000 --> 40:11.600
Be prepared to suffer working under him.

40:12.321 --> 40:13.480
Being strict is a good thing.

40:13.881 --> 40:15.201
I don't think of honing as suffering.

40:27.241 --> 40:29.600
Sir, upstairs is where the dorm and entertainment space are.

40:29.761 --> 40:32.480
Through the courtyard, we'll come to the canteen.

40:32.881 --> 40:33.881
It's so big.

40:35.080 --> 40:36.536
The fire station has a dog?

40:36.560 --> 40:37.960
Yes, our captain took him in.

40:38.681 --> 40:39.896
-What's its name? -Xiao Meng.

40:39.920 --> 40:41.817
Xiao Meng is well-trained by our captain.

40:41.841 --> 40:43.400
Almost as good as a professional K9.

40:45.400 --> 40:46.400
Hello, Xiao Meng.

40:47.761 --> 40:49.337
-Sir! -Why did it bite?

40:49.361 --> 40:50.376
It's okay. Calm down. It doesn't bite.

40:50.400 --> 40:51.480
-It doesn't bite? -It's okay.

40:51.641 --> 40:54.096
-Sir. -That's enough. Down.

40:54.120 --> 40:56.337
Let me show you the canteen. It's that way.

40:56.361 --> 40:57.600
Nice to meet you, Master Meng.

41:20.281 --> 41:21.281
Captain Song.

41:22.361 --> 41:24.976
Yang Chi took me on a tour of the station already.

41:25.000 --> 41:26.801
I have some things I'd like to know more from you.

41:27.600 --> 41:28.600
You should rest early.

41:28.681 --> 41:30.321
I normally sleep late.

41:30.841 --> 41:31.841
I'm still wide awake.

41:40.801 --> 41:41.801
I need to go on patrol.

41:42.080 --> 41:43.201
Let me go with you.
